120:Section headers carry the same marks, and a section where every row is ⊘ says "Actions don't animate this. Edits here change the clip." Each sub-tab's label shows **◆N** when the selected action animates N of its keys. When you select an action, the sections it animates on the current sub-tab open automatically.
